	(text "Straps left at chip defaults:\nGPIO3 float (JTAG source: eFuse default = USB-Serial-JTAG)\nGPIO45 int. pull-down -> VDD_SPI = 3.3 V\nGPIO46 int. pull-down -> download boot allowed"
